{"id":"word:hebrew:H4932","type":"word","title":"מִשְׁנֶה","subtitle":"H4932 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"properly, a repetition , i.e. a duplicate ( copy of a document), or a double (in amount); by implication, a second (in order, rank, age, quality or location)","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to מִשְׁנֶה (H4932) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 35 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"מִשְׁנֶה (mishneh) means properly, a repetition , i.e. a duplicate ( copy of a document), or a double (in amount); by implication, a second (in order, rank, age, quality or location) First listed occurrence: 1Chr 5 12."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"מִשְׁנֶה","transliteration":"mishneh","pronunciation":"mish-neh'","strong":"H4932","lemmaId":"hebrew:H4932","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["הַ/מִּשְׁנֶ֑ה","מִשְׁנֶ֔ה","וּ/מִשְׁנֵ֣/הוּ","מִשְׁנֶֽה","בַּ/מִּשְׁנֶ֑ה"],"morphs":[["HNcmsa",12],["HTd/Ncmsa",6],["HNcmsc",4],["HC/Ncmsc/Sp3ms",3],["HR/Ncmsa",2],["HRd/Ncmsa",2],["HC/Ncmsa",2],["HTd/Ncmpa",1],["HNcmsc/Sp3ms",1],["HC/Td/Ncmpa",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"properly, a repetition , i.e. a duplicate ( copy of a document), or a double (in amount); by implication, a second (in order, rank, age, quality or location)","usage":"college, copy, double, fatlings, next, second (order), twice as much.","full":"H4932. mishneh מִשְׁנֶה noun [masculine] double, copy, second ; — absolute ׳מ Gen 41:43 +; construct מִשְׁנֵה Jer 16:18 3 t., so read also Deut 15:18 (van d. H., &gt; נֶה - Gi), Jer 17:18 (Gie Buhl and others); suffix מִשְׁנֵהוּ 1Sam 8:2 +; plural מִשְׁנִים 1Chr 15:18 ( 1Sam 15:9 ; Ezra 1:10 see below); — 1 (the) double: מ ׳כֶּסֶף Gen 43:12 (J) money of double amount , compare ׳מ כֶּסֶף 43:15 (J), a double amount (in) money (Ges § 131q ); מ ׳לֶחֶם Exod 16:22 (P); ׳וגו אֲשֶׁר׳מ עַל 16:5 (P) the double above what they gathered daily; שָׂכִיר שְׂכַר מִשְׁנֵה Deut 15:18 (see Dr); ׳מ עֲוֺנָם Jer 16:18 the double of their guilt , 17:18 (see above); a double portion Isa 61:7 (twice in verse); Zech 9:12 ; Job 42:10 . 2 written copy of law Deut 17:18 ; Josh 8:32 (D). 3 second in order a. second, rank , הַמּ ׳מִרְכֶּבֶת Gen 41:43 (J), הַמּ ׳רֶכֶב 2Chr 35:24 ; of person one second in rank , priest next to high-priest, ׳(הַ)מ 2Kin 23:4 ; 25:18 = Jer 52:24 ; לְמ ׳אֶהְיֶהלְּֿךָ 1Sam 23:17 , הַמֶּלֶךְ מִשְׁנֵה 2Chr 28:7 , ׳מ לַמֶּלֶךְ Est 10:3 ; 1Chr 15:18 ; 16:5 ; 2Chr 31:12 ; ׳מ מֵאֶחָיו Neh 11:17 . &#8212; 1Sam 15:9 read (compare ᵑ7 ᵑ6 ) הַמַּשְׁמַנִּים ( Neh 8:10 ) Th, הַשְּׁמַנִּים or הַשְּׁמֵנִים We Dr Bu, etc. ( Ezek 34:16 ); ׳מִשׁ Ezra 1:10 is apparently corruption of a numeral. b. second in age , 1Sam 8:2 ; 17:13 ; 2Sam 3:3 ; 1Chr 5:12 . 3 second quarter, district , of city, הַמִּשְׁנֶה 2Kin 22:14 2Chr 34:22 ; Zeph 1:10 , compare מִשְׁנֶה הָעִיר Neh 11:9 over the city , namely, the second quarter.","rootNote":"from 8138 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 5 12","keyReferences":["1Chr 5 12","1Chr 15 18","1Chr 16 5","1Sam 8 2","1Sam 15 9","1Sam 17 13","1Sam 23 17","2Chr 28 7"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":35,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 5 12","book":"1Chr","chapter":5,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/מִּשְׁנֶ֑ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 15 18","book":"1Chr","chapter":15,"verse":18,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/מִּשְׁנִ֑ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmpa"},{"reference":"1Chr 16 5","book":"1Chr","chapter":16,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/מִשְׁנֵ֣/הוּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Sam 8 2","book":"1Sam","chapter":8,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִשְׁנֵ֖/הוּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Sam 15 9","book":"1Sam","chapter":15,"verse":9,"englishText":"",